  "quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Ironically, while we have more data than ever before, compliance teams continue to struggle with hidden fraud patterns, regulatory risk.",
      "timestamp_sec": 53,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=53s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The reason is the most existing solution analyze the documents independently. While many of the most critical risk only become visible when the information is connected across the multiple systems.",
      "timestamp_sec": 53,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=53s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Modern fraud rarely appears as an obvious error within a single document.",
      "timestamp_sec": 110,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=110s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Traditional rule-based and document-level NLP system are designed to validate individual records, but they are not built to understand relationship across the documents.",
      "timestamp_sec": 166,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=166s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The challenge is that many sophisticated fraud patterns doesn't really appear within a single document. They emerges only when the multiple documents are analyzed together.",
      "timestamp_sec": 226,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=226s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "What missing is the ability to understand the relationship between these documents.",
      "timestamp_sec": 275,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=275s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Instead of generating alerts based on single rule, it it prioritizes the cases using the multiple risk signals here.",
      "timestamp_sec": 324,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=324s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "In simple terms, this component answers one fundamental question, what is connected?",
      "timestamp_sec": 443,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=443s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The important advantage is its ability to learn from the audit outcomes, allowing the models to continuously improve its accuracy over the time.",
      "timestamp_sec": 501,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=501s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Without normalization, the same transaction can be interpreted differently depending on the jurisdiction.",
      "timestamp_sec": 501,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=501s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The framework was evaluated using the approximately 3 million of the financial records collected over 5 years of period over the four different regulatory jurisdictions.",
      "timestamp_sec": 560,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=560s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The framework achieved approximately 91% of precision, meaning the vast majority of the flat cases were confirmed as a genuine anomalies here.",
      "timestamp_sec": 622,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=622s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "So, together, these results produce a F1 score that is 0.89, indicating a strong balance between the precision and recall here.",
      "timestamp_sec": 622,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=622s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "One of the most significant outcome was a 76% uh reduction in false positive",
      "timestamp_sec": 688,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=688s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "In other words, the uh the framework doesn't just detect fraud more effectively, it helps compliance teams work more effectively.",
      "timestamp_sec": 741,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=741s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "As fraud patterns evolve and business, uh, environments changes, the framework adopts rather than relying on manual rule updates.",
      "timestamp_sec": 857,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=857s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Instead of asking what went wrong, organizations can begin asking what is likely to go wrong next.",
      "timestamp_sec": 916,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=916s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Ultimately, the compliance becomes an ongoing intelligence functions rather than a periodic review process.",
      "timestamp_sec": 916,
      "talk_slug": "ai-driven-multi-document-correlation-for-financial-compliance",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwe_RY-fYgI&t=916s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "First is many of today's most significant compliance and fraud risk exist between the documents, not within them.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1027,
